OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786695494
OL,3,CPop-up display of Andy Warhol's
OL,4,Cartwork in lorry
OL,6,FA one-day-only exhibition of Andy
OL,7,FWarhol's iconic sketches, prints, and
OL,8,Fphotographs has been displayed in a
OL,9,Florry as part of a community
OL,10,Fcelebration.
OL,12,FMasterpieces by the legendary pop
OL,13,Fartist have been displayed in an art
OL,14,Ftruck parked on Rochdale Town Hall
OL,15,FSquare on Thursday, 13 August.
OL,17,FThe surprise display is part of the
OL,18,Ftown's Side by Side festival, a three-
OL,19,Fday community celebration organised by
OL,20,Fthe charity Your Trust and its
OL,21,Fpartners.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
