PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786695494
OL,3,CPop-up display of Andy Warhol's
OL,4,Cartwork in lorry
OL,6,FThe event previews a larger 2027
OL,7,Fcollaboration ARTIST ROOMS and the
OL,8,Flocal gallery Touchstones, which is
OL,9,Fcurrently being being re-developed.
OL,11,FA Middleton-based women's community
OL,12,Farts group The Aloe Veras also
OL,13,Fcontributed to co-curating the
OL,14,Fupcoming exhibition.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786695494
OL,3,CPop-up display of Andy Warhol's
OL,4,Cartwork in lorry
OL,6,FMark Doyle, Director of Arts, Heritage
OL,7,Fand Wellness at Your Trust and
OL,8,FTouchstones Rochdale said: "This is a
OL,9,Ffantastic opportunity for the people
OL,10,Facross Rochdale Borough to experience
OL,11,Fworld-renowned art right on their
OL,12,Fdoorstep.
OL,14,F"At its heart, it's about making
OL,15,Fculture accessible to everyone and
OL,16,Fdemonstrates our commitment to
OL,17,F'opening culture to all'."
OL,19,FHe added: "Rochdale is experiencing a
OL,20,Fbit of a cultural renaissance.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786695494
OL,3,CPop-up display of Andy Warhol's
OL,4,Cartwork in lorry
OL,6,F"This is one thing but there are lots
OL,7,Fof things that are happening across
OL,8,Fthe town led by the Rochdale
OL,9,Fdevelopment agency who have a culture
OL,10,Fteam who are doing amazing things at
OL,11,Fthe moment."
OL,13,FCeri Lewis, Senior Curator for ARTIST
OL,14,FROOMS said: "We've been working with
OL,15,FTouchstones for a number of years and
OL,16,Fwe've got a project that's been
OL,17,Fdeveloped that will come into their
OL,18,Fbuilding when its ready next year.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786695494
OL,3,CPop-up display of Andy Warhol's
OL,4,Cartwork in lorry
OL,6,F"But today we wanted to celebrate that
OL,7,Fpartnership to be part of the Side by
OL,8,FSide festival, and in doing so we've
OL,9,Fbrought the work of one of the most
OL,10,Ffamous artists of our collection right
OL,11,Finto the heart of Rochdale in an art
OL,12,Ftruck, so that everyone today at the
OL,13,Ffestival can see work of one of the
OL,14,Fmost famous artists.
OL,16,F"He's an artist that genuinely
OL,17,Fbelieved that art should be for
OL,18,Feveryone. He was all about making art
OL,19,Faccessible for the masses."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
